{"unit_id":"Sal7one__DSH-Design-Studio#feature-1","repo":"Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio","commit":"b1002120c3acfabf05e14dc1cc6eeb2e83591dde","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Design Studio 的功能「实时预览」：编辑 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 设计稿后，可在 Studio 标签页查看页面并选择界面元素。通过 DSH 工具和界面使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2182","lib/index.js:2117"]}
